<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - CORESTAFF cut to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - CORESTAFF cut to buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Alex. Brown said it lowered its recommendation on CORESTAFF Inc to buy from strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares were off two to 21-1/4 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immediately available to comment.</p>
</text>
